# Dependencies
node_modules
npm-debug.log*

# Build output
dist
build

# Development files
.git
.gitignore
.vscode
.idea
*.md
!README.md
!CHANGELOG.md
!CHANGELOG.fr.md

# AI agents' working directories, which the image needs none of. The builder
# copies the whole context (COPY . .):
# - .claude/worktrees/ holds whole checkouts of the repository, often older
#   ones, and Tailwind's scan there would read their components: this file
#   drops the .gitignore that names them, at the root only, and a checkout's
#   own copy of it does not name its own components.
# - .gstack/ is gstack's state: its browser's access token, cookies and
#   storage, the logs of the pages and requests it made, and the probes of /qa
#   and /review. Left out, none of it is sent to the builder or kept in the
#   builder stage's layer.
.claude/
.gstack/

# Environment files
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Test files
coverage
*.test.*
*.spec.*

# OS files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Kubernetes configs (not needed in image)
k8s/

# Docker files
Dockerfile*
docker-compose*
.dockerignore
